{"id":"68e2d5e250a907ad","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-church-turing.md","title":"Church-Turing Thesis","display":"thm-church-turing — Church-Turing Thesis","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-church-turing","aliases":["57-thm-church-turing"],"display":"thm-church-turing — Church-Turing Thesis","depends_on":["[[90-df-effective-procedure]]","[[90-df-recursive-function]]","[[90-df-normal-form-theorem]]","[[88-df-turing-machine]]","[[88-df-encoding]]","[[57-df-recursive-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-church-turing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-church-turing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-church-turing — Church-Turing Thesis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4de0ebda11529dc6\" href=\"?note=4de0ebda11529dc6\" title=\"90-df-effective-procedure\">90-df-effective-procedure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8105afc544202519\" href=\"?note=8105afc544202519\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function\">90-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"73df8af25850d4b3\" href=\"?note=73df8af25850d4b3\" title=\"90-df-normal-form-theorem\">90-df-normal-form-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" href=\"?note=e0bc676c7a4a4b11\" title=\"88-df-turing-machine\">88-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3cca93ccf127333f\" href=\"?note=3cca93ccf127333f\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function\">57-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\ge1\">\\(k\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为部分函数。输入和输出固定为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wordenc}\">\\(\\operatorname{wordenc}\\)</span> 数值元组表示。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Effective}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Effective}(f)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4de0ebda11529dc6\" href=\"?note=4de0ebda11529dc6\" title=\"90-df-effective-procedure\">90-df-effective-procedure</a> 的形式化、相对表示的谓词，不指尚未形式化的经验概念；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3cca93ccf127333f\" href=\"?note=3cca93ccf127333f\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function\">57-df-recursive-function</a>。本文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}\">\\(\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}\\)</span> 是下式给出的同表示机器可计算性接口。</p>\n<p>本环境取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\mathbb N^k\">\\(X=\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=\\mathbb N\">\\(Y=\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_X=\\operatorname{in}_k\">\\(\\iota_X=\\operatorname{in}_k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_Y=\\operatorname{out}\">\\(\\iota_Y=\\operatorname{out}\\)</span>；无下标 Effective 使用这一对表示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{in}_k:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\{0,1\\}^*,\\qquad\\operatorname{in}_k(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\vec x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{in}_k:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\{0,1\\}^*,\\qquad\\operatorname{in}_k(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\vec x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{out}:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^*,\\qquad\\operatorname{out}(y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle y\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{out}:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^*,\\qquad\\operatorname{out}(y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle y\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\operatorname{in}_k,\\operatorname{out}}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\operatorname{in}_k,\\operatorname{out}}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Effective}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rec}(f),\\qquad\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Effective}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rec}(f),\\qquad\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正文仅陈述已经形式定义的机器模型与部分递归函数的等价性。历史上的 Church–Turing 论题涉及非形式的“有效过程”，不能靠同名谓词把该经验论题变成已证明的数学定理。文件名与调用名不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-effective-procedure","status":"resolved","id":"4d