 [[90-df-effective-procedure]] 的形式化、相对表示的谓词，不指尚未形式化的经验概念；$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function]]。本文件的 $\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}$ 是下式给出的同表示机器可计算性接口。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"3cca93ccf127333f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\ge1$，$f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 为部分函数。输入和输出固定为 [[88-df-encoding]] 的 $\\operatorname{wordenc}$ 数值元组表示。$\\mathrm{Effective}(f)$ 取 [[90-df-effective-procedure]] 的形式化、相对表示的谓词，不指尚未形式化的经验概念；$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function]]。本文件的 $\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}$ 是下式给出的同表示机器可计算性接口。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wordenc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Effective}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"Y=\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_X=\\operatorname{in}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_Y=\\operatorname{out}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{in}_k:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\{0,1\\}^*,\\qquad\\operatorname{in}_k(\\vec x)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\vec x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{out}:\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}^*,\\qquad\\operatorname{out}(y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{wordenc}(\\langle y\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\operatorname{in}_k,\\operatorname{out}}(f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Effective}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rec}(f),\\qquad\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Turing\\text{-}Comp}(f).","display":true}],"bytes":1817,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-226","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-downward-LS]]\n[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-interpolation]]\n[[57-thm-Lomega1omega-no-compactness]]\n